-width-down/320?cb=20190602061515","caption":"Снимок экрана · Суисуитчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/87/Bandicam_2019-06-02_02-13-27-911.png/revision/latest?cb=20190602061515"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Suisuitchi_artwork.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a8/Suisuitchi_artwork.png/revision/latest?cb=20150912045614","caption":"Иллюстрация · Суисуитчи"}],"related":[]}